#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:381
msgid "The most common archive format on Linux and Unix-like systems is the tar archive compressed with <command>gzip</command> or <command>bzip2</command>."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ທີ່ສຸດໃນລະບົບ Linux ແລະ Unix ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ Tar ທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດດ້ວຍ <command>"
"gzip</command> ຫຼື <command>bzip2</command>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:382
msgid "The most common archive format on Microsoft Windows systems is the archive created with <application>PKZIP</application> or <application>WinZip</application>."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ທີ່ສຸດໃນລະບົບ Microsoft Windows ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ <application>"
"PKZIP</application> ຫຼື <application>WinZip</application>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:383
msgid "Compressed Non-Archive Files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ລວມ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:385
msgid "A compressed non-archive file is a file that is created when you use <command>bzip2</command>, <command>gzip</command>, <command>lzip</command>, <command>lzop</command>, <command>compress</command> or <command>rzip</command> to compress a non-archive file. For example, <filename>file.txt.gz</filename> is created when you use <command>gzip</command> to compress <filename>file.txt</filename>."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ລວມ ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຈົ້ານຳໃຊ້ <command>bzip2</command>, "
"<command>gzip</command>, <command>lzip</command>, <command>lzop</command>, "
"<command>compress</command> ຫຼື <command>rzip</command> ເພື່ອບີບອັດໄຟລ໌ດ່ຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"<filename>file.txt.gz</filename> ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຈົ້ານຳໃຊ້ <command>gzip</command> "
"ເພື່ອບີບອັດ <filename>file.txt</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:386
msgid "You can use <application>Archive Manager</application> to create, open and extract a compressed non-archive file."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ເພື່ອສ້າງ, ເປີດ ແລະ ແ"
"ຍກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດແບບດ່ຽວໄດ້."

