"application> ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເນື້ອໃນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ຈະສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງແຖບສະຖານະ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ເບິ່ງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບສະຖານະ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. ເພື່ອສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະຄືນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູດຽວກັນນັ້ນອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:461
msgid "When you right-click in the <application>Archive Manager</application> window, the application displays a popup menu. The popup menu contains the most common contextual archive commands."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຄລິກຂວາໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application>, ໂປຣແກຣມຈະ"
"ສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບຂຶ້ນມາ. ເມນູປັອບອັບນີ້ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:463
msgid "Browsing the Filesystem"
msgstr "ການທ່ອງເບິ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:465
msgid "Several <application>Archive Manager</application> dialogs (<guilabel>New</guilabel>, <guilabel>Open</guilabel>, <guilabel>Extract</guilabel>,...) enable you to browse files and folders on your computer. Refer to the <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-guide/filechooser-open\">Desktop User Guide</link> to learn more about using the file browsing dialogs."
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> (<guilabel>ສ້າງໃ"
"ໝ່</guilabel>, <guilabel>ເປີດ</guilabel>, <guilabel>ແຍກໄຟລ໌</guilabel>,...) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍ"
"ໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້. ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກາ"
"ນນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ທີ່ <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-guide/filechooser-"
"open\">ຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້ເດັສທັອບ</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:468
msgid "You can also refer to the <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-guide/caja-bookmarks\">Bookmarks section</link> of the Desktop User Guide to learn how you can use the <guilabel>Places</guilabel> pane to access your favorite locations."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງ <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-guide/caja-bookmarks\">ພາກສ່ວນບຸກ"
"ມາກ (Bookmarks)</link> ຂອງຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້ເດັສທັອບ ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ່ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ແຖບ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</"
"guilabel> ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:479
msgid "Working With Archives"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:481
msgid "When you use <application>Archive Manager</application> to work with an archive, all changes are saved to disk immediately. For example, if you delete a file from an archive, <application>Archive Manager</application> deletes the file as soon as you click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. This behavior is different to that of most applications, which save the changes to disk only when you quit the application or select <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem> in the menu."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້ານຳໃຊ້ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ທຸກ"
"ໆການປ່ຽນແປງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌ທັນທີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເຈົ້າລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, <application>ໂປ"
"ຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນທັນທີທີ່ເຈົ້າຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</"
"guibutton>. ເຊິ່ງຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປິດໂປຣແກຣມ ຫຼື "
"ເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ບັນທຶກ</guimenuitem> ໃນເມນູ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:483
msgid "If an archive is very large, or you have a slow system, some archive actions can take significant time. To abort the current action, press <keycap>Esc</keycap>. Alternatively, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stop</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or click <guibutton>Stop</guibutton> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ, ການດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ເ"
"ພື່ອຍົກເລີກການດຳເນີນການປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ <keycap>Esc</keycap>. ຫຼື ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ເບິ່ງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຢຸດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ "
"<guibutton>ຢຸດ</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:495
msgid "UI Component"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ (UI)"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:497
msgid "Action"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:502
msgid "Window"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:503
msgid "Drag an archive into the <application>Archive Manager</application> window from another application such as a file manager."
msgstr ""
"ລາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດເຂົ້າມາໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈາກແອັບພ"
"ລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:507
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເປີດ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:508
msgid "If you have recently opened the archive, it will be listed directly in the <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຫາເວັນເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງເມນູ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"guimenu></menuchoice> ໂດຍກົງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:513
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> toolbar button."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເປີດ</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:514
msgid "If you have recently opened the archive, click on the down arrow near the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> toolbar button."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຫາເວັນເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ລູກສອນລົງຂ້າງປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເປີດ</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່"
"ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:517
msgid "Right-click popup menu"
msgstr "ເມນູປັອບອັບຈາກການຄລິກຂວາ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:518
msgid "Right-click on the archive, then choose <guilabel>Open</guilabel> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guilabel>ເປີດ</guilabel> ຈາກເມນູປັອບອັບ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:521
msgid "Shortcut keys"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:522
msgid "Press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr "ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:486
msgid "In <application>Archive Manager</application>, you can perform the same action in several ways. For example, you can open an archive in the following ways: <_:informaltable-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ໃນ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application>, ເຈົ້າສາມາດດຳເນີນການດຽວກັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍ"
"ວິທີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້: <_:informaltable-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:528
msgid "This manual documents functionality from the menubar."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄຳສັ່ງຈາກແຖບເມນູ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:532
msgid "Filename Patterns"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:534
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> enables you to add, extract, or delete several files at once. To apply an action to all files that match a certain pattern, enter the pattern in the text box. The pattern can include standard wildcard symbols such as <keycap>*</keycap> to match any string, and <keycap>?</keycap> to match any single symbol. You can enter several patterns separated by semicolons. <application>Archive Manager</application> applies the action to all files that match at least one of the patterns. The examples in the following table show how to use filename patterns to select files."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມ, ແຍກ ຫຼື ລຶບໄຟລ໌ຫຼ"
"າຍໆໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການກັບທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຮູບແບບນັ້ນລົງໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຮູ"
"ບແບບສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍມາດຕະຖານ ເຊັ່ນ <keycap>*</keycap> ເພື່ອແທນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ແລະ "
"<keycap>?</keycap> ເພື່ອແທນຕົວອັກສອນດ່ຽວໃດໆກໍໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ້ອນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ"
"ຈ້ຳຈຸດ (;). <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະດຳເນີນການກັບທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງ"
"ກັບຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວຢ່າງໃນຕາຕະລາງລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:543
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:545
msgid "Files Matched"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັນ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:550
msgid "<filename>*</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>*</filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:551
msgid "All files"
msgstr "ທຸກໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:554
msgid "<filename>*.tar*</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>*.tar*</filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:555
msgid "All files with extension <filename>tar</filename>, including those in which the <filename>tar</filename> extension is followed by any sequence of symbols, such as <filename>filename.tar.gz</filename>"
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ <filename>tar</filename>, ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນໆຕໍ່ທ້າຍ ເຊັ່ນ "
"<filename>filename.tar.gz</filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:558
msgid "<filename>*.jpg; *.jpeg</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>*.jpg; *.jpeg</filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:559
msgid "All files with extension <filename>jpg</filename> and all files with extension <filename>jpeg</filename>"
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ <filename>jpg</filename> ແລະ ທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ <filename>jpeg</"
"filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:562
msgid "<filename>file?.gz</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>file?.gz</filename>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:563
msgid "All files with extension <filename>gz</filename> that have the name \"file\" followed by any single character, e.g. <filename>file2.gz</filename>, <filename>filex.gz</filename>."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ <filename>gz</filename> ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ \"file\" ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນດ່ຽວໃດໜຶ່"
"ງ ຕົວຢ່າງ: <filename>file2.gz</filename>, <filename>filex.gz</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:572
msgid "To Open an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:578
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Open</guilabel> dialog. Alternatively press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>, or click <guibutton>Open</guibutton> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເປີດ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເປີດ</guilabel>. ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo>"
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>O</keycap></keycombo>, ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເປີດ</"
"guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:581
msgid "Select the archive that you want to open."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:584
msgid "Click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເປີດ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:574
msgid "To open an archive, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:591
msgid "The archive name in the window titlebar"
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃນແຖບຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:594
msgid "The archive contents in the display area"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃນພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:597
msgid "The number files and folders (objects) in the current location, and their size when uncompressed, in the statusbar"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ (ວັດຖຸ) ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງມັນເມື່ອແຍກອອກ, ໃນແຖບສະຖານະ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:588
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> automatically determines the archive type, and displays: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະກວດສອບປະເພດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັ"
"ດ, ແລະ ສະແດງ: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:601
msgid "To open another archive, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem></menuchoice> again. <application>Archive Manager</application> opens each archive in a new window. You can't open another archive in the same window."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເປີ"
"ດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ອີກຄັ້ງ. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ຈະເປີດແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໃໝ່. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດອື່ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:604
msgid "If you try to open an archive that was created in a format that <application>Archive Manager</application> does not recognize, the application displays an error message. See <xref linkend=\"engrampa-intro\"/> for a list of supported formats."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າພະຍາຍາມເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ, ໂປຣແກຣມຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ. ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-"
"intro\"/> ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:610
msgid "To Select Files in an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:612
msgid "To select all files in an archive, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Select All</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລືອກທຸກໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ເລືອກທັງໝົດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>"
"Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:614
msgid "To deselect all files in an archive, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Deselect All</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or press <keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທຸກໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທັງໝົດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo>"
"<keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>A</keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:620
msgid "To Extract Files From an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີແຍກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:625
msgid "Select the files that you want to extract. To select more files, press-and-hold <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> and click on the files you want to select."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແຍກອອກ. ເພື່ອເລືອກຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້"
"ວຄລິກເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:628
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Extract</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Extract</guilabel> dialog. Alternatively click <guibutton>Extract</guibutton> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຍກໄຟລ໌</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ແຍກໄຟລ໌</guilabel>. ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ "
"<guibutton>ແຍກໄຟລ໌</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:631
msgid "Select the folder where <application>Archive Manager</application> extracts the files."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໂຟນເດີບ່ອນທີ່ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະແຍກໄຟລ໌ໄປໄວ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:634
msgid "Select the required extract options. For more information about the extract options, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-extract-options\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກການແຍກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເລືອກການແຍກໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-extract-options\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:637
msgid "Click <guibutton>Extract</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ແຍກໄຟລ໌</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:640
#: C/index.docbook:798
msgid "If all of the files in the archive are protected by a password, and you have not specified it, <application>Archive Manager</application> asks you to enter the password."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຖືກປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລະ ເເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸມັນໄວ້, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດ"
"ການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະຖາມໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:643
msgid "If some but not all of the files in the archive are protected by a password, and you have not specified the password, <application>Archive Manager</application> does not ask for a password. However, <application>Archive Manager</application> extracts only the unprotected files."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບາງໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຖືກປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງໝົດ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານ, "
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະບໍ່ຖາມລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໂປຣແ"
"ກຣມຈະແຍກອອກມາສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະຫັດຜ່ານເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:646
#: C/index.docbook:804
msgid "For more information about passwords, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-encrypt-files\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-encrypt-files\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:622
msgid "To extract files from an open archive, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແຍກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:653
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> also provides ways of extracting files from an archive in a file manager window, without opening a <application>Archive Manager</application> window. See <xref linkend=\"engrampa-fmgr\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຍັງມີວິທີການແຍກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃນໜ້"
"າຕ່າງຈັດການໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application>. "
"ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-fmgr\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:654
msgid "The Extract operation extracts a <emphasis>copy</emphasis> of the specified files from the archive. The extracted files have the same permissions and modification date as the original files that were added to the archive."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການແຍກໄຟລ໌ຈະແຍກ <emphasis>ສຳເນົາ</emphasis> ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ. ໄຟ"
"ລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແຍກອອກມາຈະມີການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ວັນທີແກ້ໄຂຄືກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:657
msgid "The Extract operation does not change the contents of the archive. For information on how to delete files from an archive, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-delete-files\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການແຍກໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເນື້ອໃນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ບີ"
"ບອັດ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-delete-files\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:663
msgid "To Close an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີປິດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:665
msgid "To close the current archive and the current <application>Archive Manager</application> window, choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>Archive</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, or press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ປັດ"
"ຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice> <guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ປິດ</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</"
"keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:668
msgid "There is no way to close the current archive but not the <application>Archive Manager</application> window."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີວິທີການປິດສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:676
msgid "Creating Archives"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:678
msgid "In addition to opening existing archives, you can also create new archives with <application>Archive Manager</application>."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດ"
"ການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:680
msgid "To Create an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:686
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>New</guilabel> dialog. Alternatively press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>, or click <guibutton>New</guibutton> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ສ້າງໃໝ່</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ສ້າງໃໝ່</guilabel>. ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo>"
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>, ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສ້າງໃ"
"ໝ່</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:690
msgid "Specify the folder where <application>Archive Manager</application> places the new archive clicking on the entry in the <guilabel>Save in folder</guilabel> drop-down list. If the folder is not present in list, click on <guilabel>Browse for other folders</guilabel>, and select the folder. Alternatively, enter the path in the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> text box."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸໂຟນເດີບ່ອນທີ່ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະເກັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ ໂດ"
"ຍຄລິກເລືອກໃນລາຍການ <guilabel>ບັນທຶກໃນໂຟນເດີ</guilabel>. ຖ້າໂຟນເດີບໍ່ມີໃນລາຍຊື່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ "
"<guilabel>ທ່ອງເບິ່ງໂຟນເດີອື່ນໆ</guilabel>, ແລ້ວເລືອກໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຫຼື ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) "
"ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:694
msgid "Enter the name of the new archive, including the file extension, in the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> text box. Alternatively you can specify the archive name without extension, and then select the archive type from the <guilabel>Archive type</guilabel> drop-down menu, this way the extension will be added automatically."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ ລວມທັງນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel>. ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາ"
"ດລະບຸຊື່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃສ່ນາມສະກຸນ, ແລ້ວເລືອກປະເພດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຈາກເມນູ <guilabel>ປະເພດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"guilabel>, ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ນາມສະກຸນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:697
#: C/index.docbook:791
#: C/index.docbook:1327
msgid "Select the required create options clicking on <guilabel>Other Options</guilabel>. For more information about the create options, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-create-options\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ <guilabel>ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ</guilabel>. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່"
"ຽວກັບຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-create-options\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:701
msgid "Click <guibutton>New</guibutton>. <application>Archive Manager</application> creates an empty archive, but does not yet write the archive to disk."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ສ້າງໃໝ່</guibutton>. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກລົງໃນດິສກ໌ເທື່ອ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:707
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> writes a new archive to disk only when the archive contains at least one file. If you create a new archive and quit <application>Archive Manager</application> before you add any files to the archive, <application>Archive Manager</application> deletes the archive."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ລົງໃນດິສກ໌ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນມີ"
"ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ ແລະ ປິດ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັ"
"ດ</application> ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ໃດໆເຂົ້າໄປ, ໂປຣແກຣມຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດນັ້ນຖິ້ມ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:705
msgid "Add files to the new archive as described in <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-files\"/>. <_:note-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-files\"/>. "
"<_:note-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:682
msgid "To create an archive, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:717
msgid "To Add Files to an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:723
#: C/index.docbook:751
msgid "Decide where in the archive you want to add the files, then open that location in the archive."
msgstr ""
"ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໃດພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ແລ້ວເປີດຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:726
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add Files</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Add Files</guilabel> dialog, or click <guibutton>Add Files</guibutton> in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌</guilabel>, ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>"
"ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌</guibutton> ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:729
msgid "Select the files that you want to add. To select more files press-and-hold <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> and click the files."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ. ເພື່ອເລືອກຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວຄລິກ"
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:732
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>. <application>Archive Manager</application> adds the files to the current folder in the archive."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມ</guibutton>. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ຈະເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:719
msgid "To add files to an archive, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:737
msgid "You cannot add folders to the archive with the <guilabel>Add Files</guilabel> dialog. To add a folder see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-folder\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຜ່ານກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ໄດ້. ເພື່ອເ"
"ພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-folder\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:738
msgid "The <guilabel>Add Files</guilabel> dialog provides the <guilabel>Add only if newer</guilabel> option, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-options\"/> for more information on this option."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ມີຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ</"
"guilabel>, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-options\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເ"
"ລືອກນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:739
msgid "You can also add files to an archive in a file manager window, without opening an <application>Archive Manager</application> window. See <xref linkend=\"engrampa-fmgr\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຈັດການໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>ໂປຣແ"
"ກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application>. ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-fmgr\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:740
msgid "The Add operation adds a <emphasis>copy</emphasis> of the specified files or folders to the archive. <application>Archive Manager</application> does not remove the original files, which remain unchanged in the file system. The copies that are added to the archive have the same permissions and modification date as the original files."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການເພີ່ມຈະເພີ່ມ <emphasis>ສຳເນົາ</emphasis> ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ລະບຸເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັ"
"ດ. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະບໍ່ລຶບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງພວກມັນຍັງຄື"
"ເກົ່າຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ສຳເນົາທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຈະມີການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ວັນທີແກ້ໄຂຄືກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:745
msgid "To Add a Folder to an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:754
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add a Folder</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Add a Folder</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:757
msgid "Select the folder that you want to add."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:760
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>. <application>Archive Manager</application> adds the folder to the current folder in the archive."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມ</guibutton>. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</"
"application> ຈະເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:747
msgid "To add a folder to an archive, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:765
msgid "The <guilabel>Add a Folder</guilabel> dialog provides several advanced options. See <xref linkend=\"engrampa-add-options\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີ</guilabel> ມີຕົວເລືອກຂັ້ນສູງຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-add-options\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:769
msgid "To Convert an Archive to Another Format"
msgstr "ວິທີແປງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:771
msgid "To convert an archive to another format and save as a new file, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແປງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:775
msgid "Open the archive that you want to convert."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແປງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:779
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Save</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ບັນທຶກເປັນ</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ບັນທຶກ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:783
msgid "Enter the new archive name in the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> text box."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:787
msgid "Select the new format from the <guilabel>Archive type</guilabel> drop-down list. Alternatively, enter the filename extension in the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> text box, and select <guilabel>Automatic</guilabel> from the <guilabel>Archive type</guilabel> drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຮູບແບບໃໝ່ຈາກລາຍການ <guilabel>ປະເພດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guilabel>. ຫຼື ປ້ອນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້"
"ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel>, ແລະ ເລືອກ <guilabel>ອັດຕະໂນມັດ</guilabel> ຈາກລາຍກາ"
"ນ <guilabel>ປະເພດໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:795
msgid "Click <guibutton>Save</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ບັນທຶກ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:801
msgid "If some but not all of the files in the archive are protected by a password, and you have not specified the password, <application>Archive Manager</application> does not ask for a password. However, <application>Archive Manager</application> copies only the unprotected files to the new archive."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບາງໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຖືກປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງໝົດ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານ, "
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ</application> ຈະບໍ່ຖາມລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໂປຣແ"
"ກຣມຈະຄັດລອກສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະຫັດຜ່ານໄປໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໃໝ່."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:814
msgid "Modifying the Contents of an Archive"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:816
msgid "You can modify the contents of an archive in several ways."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:821
msgid "To Encrypt Files in an Archive"
msgstr "ວິທີເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:823
msgid "For security, you might want to encrypt the files that you add to an archive."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:824
msgid "If the archive format supports encryption, you can specify a password to encrypt the files that you add to the archive."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌"
"ບີບອັດໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:826
msgid "Currently, only 7-Zip, ZIP, RAR and ARJ archives support encryption."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ບົດເກັບ 7-Zip, ZIP, RAR ແລະ ARJ ເທົັ້ນນັ້ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:828
msgid "To specify a password for file encryption, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:830
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Password</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Password</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:831
msgid "Enter the password in the <guilabel>Password</guilabel> text box."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:832
#: C/index.docbook:946
msgid "Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:834
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> uses the password to encrypt the files that you add to the current archive, and to decrypt the files that you extract from the current archive. <application>Archive Manager</application> deletes the password when you close the archive."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ"
"ໃນບົດເກັບປັດຈຸບັນ, ແລະ ເພື່ອຖອດລະຫັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າແຍກອອກຈາກບົດເກັບປັດຈຸບັນ. <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັ"
"ດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະລຶບລະຫັດຜ່ານເມື່ອເຈົ້າປິດບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:836
msgid "For information on how to check whether an archive contains encrypted files, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-extra-info\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີກວດສອບວ່າບົດເກັບມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-extra-info\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:839
msgid "The encryption provided by archive utilities is weak and insecure. If security is important, use a strong encryption tool such as <link xlink:href=\"http://www.gnupg.org\">GNU Privacy Guard</link>."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍເຄື່ອງມືຈັດການບົດເກັບແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນແໜ້ນໜາ ແລະ ບໍ່ປອດໄພພໍ. ຖ້າຄວາມປອດໄພເປັນສິ່ງສ"
"ຳຄັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ແຂງແຮງກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ <link xlink:href=\"http://"
"www.gnupg.org\">GNU Privacy Guard</link>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:845
msgid "To Rename a File in an Archive"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:847
msgid "To rename a file in an archive, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:850
msgid "Select the file that you want to rename."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນຊື່."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:853
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Rename</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or press <keycombo><keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>, to display the <guilabel>Rename</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ປ່ຽນຊື່</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>, ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"<guilabel>ປ່ຽນຊື່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:856
msgid "Enter the new filename in the <guilabel>New file name</guilabel> text box."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:859
msgid "Click <guibutton>Rename</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ປ່ຽນຊື່</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:866
msgid "To Copy Files in an Archive"
msgstr "ການສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:868
msgid "To copy files in an archive, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:871
msgid "Select the files that you want to copy."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສຳເນົາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:874
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>C</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ສຳເນົາ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>C</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:877
msgid "Open the location where you want to put the copied files."
msgstr "ເປີດໄປຍັງບ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການວາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສຳເນົາມາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:880
#: C/index.docbook:900
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ວາງ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>V</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:886
msgid "To Move Files in an Archive"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:888
msgid "To move files in an archive, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:891
msgid "Select the files that you want to move."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:894
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Cut</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>X</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຕັດ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>X</keycap></"
"keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:897
msgid "Open the location where you want to put the moved files."
msgstr "ເປີດໄປຍັງບ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການວາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຍ້າຍມາ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:906
msgid "To Delete Files From an Archive"
msgstr "ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:908
msgid "To delete files from an archive, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກບົດເກັບ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:911
msgid "Select the files that you want to delete."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:914
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or press <keycap>Delete</keycap> to display the <guilabel>Delete</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ລຶບ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ຫຼື ກົດ <keycap>Delete</keycap> ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ລຶບ</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:917
msgid "Select one of the following delete options:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກການລຶບໃດໜຶ່ງລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:920
#: C/index.docbook:1554
msgid "<guilabel>All files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:922
msgid "Delete all files from the archive."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:928
#: C/index.docbook:1562
msgid "<guilabel>Selected files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:930
msgid "Delete the selected files from the archive."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ອອກຈາກບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:936
#: C/index.docbook:1570
msgid "<guilabel>Files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ໄຟລ໌</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:938
msgid "Delete from the archive all files that match the specified pattern. See <xref linkend=\"engrampa-pattern\"/> for more information about filename patterns."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບທຸກໄຟລ໌ຈາກບົດເກັບທີ່ມີຊື່ກົງກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ລະບຸ. ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-pattern\"/> ສຳລັ"
"ບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:953
msgid "To Modify a File in an Archive"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:958
msgid "Double-click the file that you want to open. Alternatively right-click the file and choose <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດ. ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenuitem>ເປີ"
"ດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:959
msgid "Edit the file opened in step 1, and then save your changes."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1, ແລ້ວບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:960
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> shows a confirmation dialog, asking confirmation to update the file in the archive with the changes you made."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງຢືນຢັນ ເພື່ອຖາມການຢືນຢັນໃນ"
"ການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:961
msgid "Click on <guilabel>Update</guilabel>."
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ <guilabel>ອັບເດດ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:955
msgid "To modify a file in an archive perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:964
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> uses the system-defined associations between file types and programs to determine the appropriate application to launch for a specific file. These assocations can be displayed and modified in the <guilabel>Open With</guilabel> tab of the file properties dialog. If <application>Archive Manager</application> cannot determine the appropriate application, <application>Archive Manager</application> displays the <guilabel>Open Files</guilabel> dialog to let you choose an application, as described in below."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍລະບົບລະຫວ່າງປະ"
"ເພດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມ ເພື່ອເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນການເປີດໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໆ. ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດ"
"ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນແຖບ <guilabel>ເປີດດ້ວຍ</guilabel> ຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຄຸນສົມບັດໄຟລ໌. ຖ້າ "
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້, ມັນ"
"ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເອງ ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາ"
"ຍໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:966
msgid "To Modify a File in an Archive with a Custom Application"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບດ້ວຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:971
msgid "Right click the file."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:972
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Open With...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr "ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenuitem>ເປີດດ້ວຍ...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:968
msgid "You can use an application specified by you, rather than the default application, to modify a file. To use an external application to open a file: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳນົດເອງ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເ"
"ຄຊັນພາຍນອກໃນການເປີດໄຟລ໌: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:975
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> displays the <guilabel>Open Files</guilabel> dialog, which lists all of the applications that can open files of the specified type. To select one of the applications, double-click the application name or click on the application name and then click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>. Alternatively, enter the application name in the <guilabel>Application</guilabel> text box and then click <guibutton>Open</guibutton> to launch the application of your choice."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</"
"guilabel>, ເຊິ່ງລວມລາຍຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທັງໝົດທີ່ສາມາດເປີດໄຟລ໌ປະເພດນັ້ນໄດ້. ເພື່ອເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດໜຶ່"
"ງ, ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ແອັບ ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ແອັບແລ້ວກົດ <guibutton>ເປີດ</guibutton>. ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອ"
"ນຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel> ແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ເປີດ</"
"guibutton> ເພື່ອເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:976
msgid "Once the application starts follow the procedure from step 2 as described in <xref linkend=\"engrampa-modify-archive-file\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 2 ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-modify-archive-file\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:983
msgid "Viewing Archives"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:985
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> enables you to view several aspects of an archive."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຫຼາຍໆດ້ານຂອງບົ"
"ດເກັບໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:989
msgid "To View the Properties of an Archive"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:994
#: C/index.docbook:1042
msgid "<guilabel>Name</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:995
msgid "The name of the archive."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/index.docbook:999
#: C/index.docbook:1062
#: C/index.docbook:1241
msgid "<guilabel>Location</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ທີ່ຕັ້ງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1000
msgid "The position of the archive in the file system."
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງບົດເກັບໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1004
msgid "<guilabel>Modified on</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ແກ້ໄຂເມື່ອ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1005
msgid "The date and time at which the archive was last modified."
msgstr "ວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂບົດເກັບຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1009
msgid "<guilabel>Archive size</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂະໜາດບົດເກັບ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1010
msgid "The size of the archive contents when compressed."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບເມື່ອຖືກບີບອັດແລ້ວ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1014
msgid "<guilabel>Content size</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂະໜາດເນື້ອໃນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1015
msgid "The size of the archive contents when uncompressed. This information is also available in the statusbar."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ບີບອັດ (ຂະໜາດຈິງ). ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຍັງມີສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບສະຖານະນຳອີກ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1020
msgid "<guilabel>Compression ratio</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ອັດຕາສ່ວນການບີບອັດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1021
msgid "The compression ratio is a value used to describe the reduction in size of the data. For example a compression ratio of 5 means that the compressed archive is 1/5th the size of the original data."
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນການບີບອັດແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍການຫຼຸດລົງຂອງຂະໜາດຂໍ້ມູນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ອັດຕາສ່ວນການບີບອັດແມ່ນ "
"5 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບົດເກັບທີ່ບີບອັດແລ້ວມີຂະໜາດເປັນ 1/5 ຂອງຂະໜາດຂໍ້ມູນຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1026
msgid "<guilabel>Number of files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1027
msgid "The number of files in the archive."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:991
msgid "To view the properties of an archive, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> dialog. The <guilabel>Properties</guilabel> dialog displays the following information about the archive: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງບົດເກັບ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ບົດເກັບ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັ"
"ດ</guilabel>. ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບົດເກັບດັ່ງນີ້: "
"<_:variablelist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1036
msgid "To View the Contents of an Archive"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງເນື້ອໃນຂອງບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1043
msgid "The name of a file or folder in the archive."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີໃນບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1047
msgid "<guilabel>Size</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂະໜາດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1048
msgid "The size of the file when the file is extracted from the archive. For a folder, the <guilabel>Size</guilabel> field is blank. For information on how to display the size of the compressed file, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-extra-info\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກບົດເກັບ. ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ, ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ຂະໜາດ</guilabel> ຈະຫ"
"ວ່າງໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສະແດງຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-"
"extra-info\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1052
msgid "<guilabel>Type</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ປະເພດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1053
msgid "The type of the file. For a folder, the value in the <guilabel>Type</guilabel> field is <literal>Folder</literal>."
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຂອງໄຟລ໌. ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ, ຄ່າໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ປະເພດ</guilabel> ຈະແມ່ນ <literal>ໂຟນ"
"ເດີ</literal>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/index.docbook:1057
msgid "<guilabel>Date modified</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ວັນທີແກ້ໄຂ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1058
msgid "The date on which the file was last modified. For a folder, the <guilabel>Date modified</guilabel> field is blank."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ. ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ, ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ວັນທີແກ້ໄຂ</guilabel> ຈະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1063
msgid "The path to the file within the archive. This column is visible only when the window is in file view, when in folder view the location of the files is displayed in the <guilabel>Location</guilabel> text box of the folderbar. For more information about view types see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-type-folder\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃນບົດເກັບ. ຄໍລຳນີ້ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໜ້າຕ່າງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງແບບໄຟລ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຖ້າຢູ່ໃນ"
"ຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີ ທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ທີ່ຕັ້ງ</guilabel> ຂອງ"
"ແຖບໂຟນເດີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-"
"type-folder\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1039
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> displays the archive contents in the main window as a file list with the following columns: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກເປັນລາຍຊື່ໄ"
"ຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຄໍລຳຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1068
msgid "If another program has modified the archive since <application>Archive Manager</application> opened the archive, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Reload</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to reload the archive contents from disk."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນແກ້ໄຂບົດເກັບໃນຂະນະທີ່ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ເປີດ"
"ຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ໂຫຼດຄືນໃໝ່</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ເພື່ອໂຫຼດເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບຈາກດິສກ໌ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1070
msgid "For information on how to customize the way that <application>Archive Manager</application> displays the archive contents, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-archive-custom\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປັບແຕ່ງການສະແດງເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບຂອງ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</"
"application>, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-archive-custom\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1072
msgid "For more advanced tasks, use an application installed on your system. For more information, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-archive-file\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບວຽກງານທີ່ຂັ້ນສູງກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ "
"<xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-archive-file\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1077
msgid "To View a File in an Archive"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1079
msgid "To view a file in an archive follow the steps described in <xref linkend=\"engrampa-modify-archive-file\"/>. If you save the opened file, click <guilabel>Cancel</guilabel> when <application>Archive Manager</application> asks confirmation to update the file in the archive."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-modify-"
"archive-file\"/>. ຖ້າເຈົ້າບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guilabel>ຍົກເລີກ</guilabel> ເມື່ອ "
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຖາມການຢືນຢັນໃນການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1085
msgid "To Test the Integrity of an Archive"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1090
msgid "If the archive contains no errors, <application>Archive Manager</application> opens the <guilabel>Test Result</guilabel> dialog to list each file in the archive, and indicates that each file has status <literal>OK</literal>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບົດເກັບບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"<guilabel>ຜົນການທົດສອບ</guilabel> ເພື່ອລາຍຊື່ແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ໃນບົດເກັບ ແລະ ບອກສະຖານະຂອງແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌"
"ວ່າ <literal>ຕົກລົງ (OK)</literal>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1094
msgid "If the archive contains some error, <application>Archive Manager</application> opens the <guilabel>Test Result</guilabel> dialog displaying the part of the archive contains the error."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບົດເກັບມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດບາງຢ່າງ, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່"
"າງ <guilabel>ຜົນການທົດສອບ</guilabel> ເຊິ່ງລະບຸສ່ວນຂອງບົດເກັບທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1087
msgid "Sometimes an archive can be damaged for some reason, to check whether an archive is damaged, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Archive</guimenu><guimenuitem>Test Integrity</guimenuitem></menuchoice>: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງບົດເກັບອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າບົດເກັບເສຍຫາຍຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ບົດເກັບ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ທົດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນ</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice>: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1099
msgid "A damaged archive can be impossible to extract, this can bring to a loss of data. For this reason you should test the archive integrity before deleting the original files."
msgstr ""
"ບົດເກັບທີ່ເສຍຫາຍອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແຍກອອກໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້ ເຈົ້າຄວນທົດສອບຄວາມ"
"ສົມບູນຂອງບົດເກັບກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບອອກ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1101
msgid "If the archive contains encrypted files, <application>Archive Manager</application> asks the password of the archive before performing the test."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບົດເກັບມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະຖາມຫາ"
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບົດເກັບກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການທົດສອບ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:1104
msgid "Not all the archive types support the integrity testing, the following is the list of archive types that can be tested for integrity: 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP, ACE, ARJ and Zoo."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກປະເພດບົດເກັບທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບການທົດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນ, ລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ປະເພດບົດເກັບທີ່ສາມາດທົດສອບຄວາມ"
"ສົມບູນໄດ້: 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP, ACE, ARJ ແລະ Zoo."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1107
#: C/index.docbook:1408
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບ"

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/index.docbook:1109
msgid "To test the integrity of an archive that doesn't support the integrity testing, extract all the files from the archive and check that the operation is completed successfully."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທົດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງບົດເກັບທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການທົດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ລອງແຍກໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດອອກຈາກບົດ"
"ເກັບ ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າການເຮັດວຽກນັ້ນສຳເລັດສົມບູນຫຼືບໍ່."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1116
msgid "Customizing the Archive Display"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການສະແດງຜົນບົດເກັບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1118
msgid "You can customize the way that <application>Archive Manager</application> displays the archive contents, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງວິທີທີ່ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງບົດ"
"ເກັບໄດ້ ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1122
msgid "Switch between folder view and file view. For more information, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-type\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ການເບິ່ງແບບໄຟລ໌. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-view-type\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1126
msgid "Specify the order in which to display files in the list. For more information, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-sort\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດລຳດັບໃນການສະແດງໄຟລ໌ໃນລາຍຊື່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-"
"view-sort\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:1130
msgid "Display additional details about the contents of the archive. For more information, see <xref linkend=\"engrampa-extra-info\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງບົດເກັບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"engrampa-extra-info\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1134
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> updates the display immediately, when you make any of the above customizations."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະອັບເດດການສະແດງຜົນທັນທີ ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດກາ"
"ນປັບແຕ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1137
msgid "To Set the View Type"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1139
msgid "If the archive contains folders, you can show the archive contents in either <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-type-folder\"/> or <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-type-file\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບົດເກັບມີໂຟນເດີຢູ່ພາຍໃນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສະແດງເນື້ອໃນບົດເກັບໄດ້ທັງແບບ <xref linkend=\"engrampa-"
"view-type-folder\"/> ຫຼື <xref linkend=\"engrampa-view-type-file\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:1142
msgid "Folder View"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1144
msgid "<application>Archive Manager</application> displays the archive contents in folder view by default. To explicitly select folder view, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>View as a Folder</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງເນື້ອໃນໃນຮູບແບບໂ"
"ຟນເດີ. ເພື່ອເລືອກການເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີໂດຍກົງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:1146
msgid "In folder view, <application>Archive Manager</application> shows folders in the same way as a file manager shows folders. That is, <application>Archive Manager</application> indicates folders in the display area with a folder icon and the folder name. To view the contents of a folder, double-click on the folder name."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງແບບໂຟນເດີ, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັບ</application> ຈະສະແດງໂຟ"
"ນເດີໃນແບບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ສະແດງ. ນັ້ນຄື ມັນຈະສະແດງໂຟນເດີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍໄອຄອນໂ"
"ຟນເດີ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີ, ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ."

