msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "ຄຳຕິຊົມ"

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/legal.xml:78
msgid "To report a bug or make a suggestion regarding the <application>Archive Manager</application> application or this manual, follow the directions in the <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-guide/feedback\">MATE Feedback Page</link>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (bug) ຫຼື ໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການບົດເກັ"
"ບ</application> ຫຼື ຄູ່ມືນີ້, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-user-"
"guide/feedback\">ໜ້າຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງ MATE</link>."
